at's  why we created it so your your intention  has to be noble it has to stand for  something going in not just hey I want  to make a video to promote my business  that's not going to go viral because  people don't care right if I said hey  here's a video about Evan  going to go viral okay but if you create  a video that touches people somehow that  stands for something important then it's  much more likely to take off because  people love it and they believe in it  number two work with the best if you  want to have success with your video  find people who who can articulate your  creation what's in your head and turn it  into video I have done it before and who  are really great artists of what they do  if you're trying to do it yourself or if  you have somebody on your team who kind  of knows how to do video editing the  chances of that taking off are really  tiny when i created my belief video is  called believe by materials n because i  partnered up with a youtube artist named  a tourism and this is what he does he  creates amazing inspirational  motivational videos and i went to him  because I was already watching his stuff  I was watching his content I love them I  couldn't wait for the next one to come  out they engaged me and I thought you  know what if anybody's going to do a  great job of making this video it's  going to be him if anybody can take that  feeling that I want to get expressed out  there and make it into a video version  this has got to do it and he agreed and  he created an amazing product that we  were to put out on on YouTube and on our  websites so work with the best find  people who you look at their stuff and  it touches you because if it touches you  makes you feel something then it's  likely going to touch your audience with  the message that you're trying to get  out there number three plant seeds you  shouldn't have to do too much marketing  with the viral video because it's  supposed to be viral right it's supposed  to get out there people are supposed to  talk about it for you without having  advertised I got the over half a million  views on my video without spending money  on advertising just from people talking  about it but I still planted seeds at  the beginning so what I did was when the  video first came out I wrote to my  newsletter and i put on my social media  networks and i put on my website and my  two days also has a following so he put  it on his networks and we got a quick  initial surge of people coming to the  site not hundreds of thousands you know  maybe 10,000 I forget what it was on  that first day or maybe a few thousand  it wasn't that  but basically you're planting seeds so  that you have a lot of people watching  at the start and they can help spread  that message for you so it helps it  helps the video go viral much more  quickly so you don't need a plan this  huge massive campaign around it but you  want to have you want to have people who  are willing to watch it and share the  part of your network part of your  community so what I would do is you look  at who your customers are look at who  you already have on your social media  networks and share that video with them  and if you're co-creating with somebody  else have them help share just plant  some seeds so that's not starting from  absolutely nothing you have a little bit  of traction to start it off so remember  to get your viral video to work you want  to stand for something work with the  best and plant seeds believe for those  are watching you like the video you can  support me by clicking the link in the  description below give the video a  thumbs up leave a comment let me know  what you're thinking if you've created a  viral video I'd love to see it in the  comments below and click on my face  subscribe to the channel thank you so  much I'll see you soon
 

